0..77 Comment "// A pattern hole stands for an arm not yet written, at the top of a match or"
78..155 Comment "// inside a constructor\'s payload. A hole leaves which arm runs undecided, so"
156..231 Comment "// the checker refuses the match by name until coverage reads holes (#391)."
232..287 Comment "// `pathological/holes/` refuses each shape on its own."
